invariant: INV-17
file: src/pem_files.c
catches: pem_files_rsa_test
reason: In a device object, ch_rsa_key_from_pem returns with its copies
  of p, q and the three CRT values on its own stack, since the device key
  holds none of them. test_wipes searches the stack below the call and
  finds p and q.

--- old
#ifndef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    ct_wipe(crt_room, sizeof crt_room);
#endif
--- new
#ifndef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    (void)crt_room;
#endif
